# ===== 测试数据与日志 =====
# 注意：不能整目录排除 runs_*/，否则里面的驱动脚本（_mask_run.py / _gate.py 等）
# 会被一并排除——那些是源码，必须入库。故按后缀排除运行产物，保留 *.py / *.patch。
**/runs_*/*.json
**/runs_*/*.log
**/runs_*/*.txt
**/runs_*/*.tsv
**/runs_*/*.err
**/runs_*/*.bak
**/runs_*/*.pyc
**/runs_*/_*/
_*/
# `_*/` above would also swallow docs/_work (dir name starts with `_`). 2026-10-25 P0 ruler fix:
# release exactly docs/_work/** (work docs must stay trackable); everything else `_*` stays ignored.
# Trailing space removed on the `_*/` line was cosmetic -- git already strips it; the match came
# from the glob itself, so the exceptions are what actually release the path.
!docs/_work/
!docs/_work/**
*.log
*.bak
*.before-final.bak
*.round*.bak
*.err
*.tmp
*.pyc
__pycache__/

# ===== JSON（日志/运行产物）=====
*.json
# 配置样本属于源码，例外放行（注意：父目录若被整体忽略，否定规则不生效）
!legacy/biomem-legacy-src/**/config.example.json
# 夹具登记表属于源码：它记录每个 .kvmem 的 cells / sha256 / text 全文。
# *.kvmem 是二进制且可由 text 确定性重建（T-025 实测：同文本 encode 两次 sha 相同），故仍忽略；
# 但登记表若不入库，整个实验所依赖的块描述在库里就不存在。
!kvmem/m2_visibility/fixtures.json

